# ALLOWLIST: ignore everything, then re-include code and docs only.
# Never commit: competition data (DICOM, CSV labels, reports), OAI-derived files, model weights, caches, outputs, logs,
# credentials (.env, kaggle.json), scraped forum text, or pulled third-party notebooks.
*
!*/
!*.md
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.cmd
!*.ipynb
!kernel-metadata.json
!.gitignore

# directories that stay out entirely, even for allowlisted extensions
_data/
_labels/
**/pulled/
**/pulled2/
**/forum_raw/
**/forum_raw2/
**/raw/
**/__pycache__/
**/*_env/
**/_*_env/
**/out_*/
**/sim/
**/sim_*/

# credentials, always
.env
*.env
kaggle.json
**/kaggle.json

# audit working files
_audit/

# audit exclusions 10-23: competition report text, third-party personal data
**/cc_tasks/
session_2026-10-15/teamup/DRAFT_pand999.md
